//! The `grid-template` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property specifies the `grid columns`, `grid rows`, and `grid areas`.
//!
//! Initial: grid-template-columns: none; grid-template-rows: none; grid-template-areas: none.
//! Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: grid-template-columns: refer to corresponding dimension of the content area;
//! grid-template-rows: refer to corresponding dimension of the content area.
//!
//! Grammar: none | [ <'grid-template-rows'> / <'grid-template-columns'> ] | [ <line-names>? <string>
//! <track-size>? <line-names>? ]+ [ / <explicit-track-list> ]?
